 RELATIONSHIPS:{title:['Relationship structure in lived experience','哪些关系结构会在现实中反复出现？'],question:['Across different roles and environments, which established relationship patterns repeat, and where do they not?','跨不同角色与环境，哪些已经建立的关系结构会重复出现，又有哪些场景并不符合？']},
