 TIMING:{title:['Timing correspondence','当前时间激活有没有现实对应？'],question:['Around the selected Da Yun / Liu Nian context, is there a recognizable change in the themes already present in the natal chart?','在所选大运／流年的时间窗口附近，原局已有主题是否出现了可以辨认的变化？']}
