 TIMING:[['Repeated pattern — during this target window, which natal theme is showing up again?','重复出现——在这个目标时间窗口里，哪项原局主题再次出现？'],['Context specificity — is the activation limited to one role, environment or pressure?','情境限定——这次激活是否只集中在某个角色、环境或压力？'],['What does not fit — what expected activation is absent or moving in the opposite direction?','不符合之处——哪些预期激活没有出现，或者反而朝相反方向发展？']]
